'''Seraphim''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', giving Isaac wings after picking up 3 angel-related items.

== Effects ==
* Grants [[flight]] and 3 {{e|Soul Heart}}s.

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags angel|{{code|angel}} tag]]).

=== Activated Collectibles ===
{{collectible table/header}}
{{collectible rows | The Bible }}
|}

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{collectible table/header}}
{{collectible rows | Dead Dove, The Halo, Holy Grail, Holy Mantle, Mitre, Rosary }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = nr | Guardian Angel, Sworn Protector }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r | Celtic Cross, Divine Intervention, Godhead, Holy Light, Immaculate Heart, Revelation, Sacred Heart, Salvation, Sacred Orb, Scapular }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r+ | Seraphim }}
|}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr+}} Despite having the same name, the familiar {{i|Seraphim}} does not contribute to the Seraphim transformation.
* Picking up and dropping multiple, distinct copies of {{i|The Bible}} will count each copy towards the transformation. This makes {{i|Rosary}} and to a lesser degree, {{t|Rosary Bead}} especially helpful in gaining the transformation.

